steam/apps/2790700/extras/234d3e8be033e95da076052442902e65.poster.avif?t=1785966574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/234d3e8be033e95da076052442902e65.webm?t=1785966574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/extras/234d3e8be033e95da076052442902e65.mp4?t=1785966574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pop-Quiz</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've read this far, you get a perfect score on today's pop-quiz. Congratulations! Have a glizzy. Mmm.</p>", "short_description": "Rip through hostile alien worlds, harvest mutant body parts mid-combat, and adapt faster than your enemies. Every alien you harvest gives you new body parts with unique powers, like triple-jump legs, turret-dropping torsos, grenade-launching turkey heads. Steal, swap, survive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It thrives in the chaos that comes from playing with your friends.”<br>Rogueliker<br><br>“One of the most unique games I've ever played”<br>Deck Ready<br><br>“Swapmeat is electric. Runs — which are perfectly paced at about 45 minutes total — become a thoughtful balance of shooting, activating cooldowns, and swapping out body parts”<br>8.8 – Digital Chumps<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/99508a3c5d7bd26ab1a2a9333c1f510bfd4d4881/header.jpg?t=1785966574", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/c192c0b59381428635d1e1155441343bf6f5fb54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785966574", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790700/c192c0b59381428635d1e1155441343bf6f5fb54/capsule_184x69.j